摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 口令插件市场客户端：输码解锁插件，连接创作者与买家（DSHHub.co 驱动）","id":"gh:1341739151","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dshhub-market","slug":"dshhub-co/dshhub-market","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","marketplace"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 口令插件市场客户端：输码解锁插件，连接创作者与买家（DSHHub.co 驱动）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dshhub-market"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> The good stuff has a code. Enter it, get it."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"dshhub-market is the **unlock-with-a-passcode plugin market** inside DSH (DeepSeek Harness): buyers "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"enter a 6-character passcode and the plugin installs itself on the spot; creators list their plugins"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" as passcode products, generate one-time or time-limited codes, and sell them in their own private c"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"hannels, collecting payment **however they like**. The platform brings the whole package: listing, p"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"asscode generation with redemption stats, the buyer-side market, updates, skins, and backups. Run by"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"eration with redemption stats, the buyer-side market, updates, skins, and backups. Run by DSHHub.co."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## For buyers: one passcode box"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Open the plugin market inside DSH and the home screen holds exactly one thing — a small box for a si"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"arket inside DSH and the home screen holds exactly one thing — a small box for a six-character code."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"No catalog, no sign-up, no ads. As a buyer you never log in anywhere; the only door is the code itse"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"lf, something like `3K7M9P`. Where does the code come from? From the creator: a video, a livestream,"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" an article, or a community."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Try the demo code **080808**: a skin plugin unlocks and installs itself on the spot and you see the "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"effect immediately. Press Enter and everything just happens — the plugin, or a whole pack, unlocks, "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"installs and is ready to use. Updates are free from then on. It feels like typing a verification cod"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"e, because it's built to."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Entering a code unlocks and installs — that's all there is to it. You got the code from the creator;"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" no account, no sign-up, no extra steps."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Once unlocked, each card talks about two things only: **who made it** and **what it's for** — the au"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"thor, a note from them, what it does, a short guide, and how to reach them. No ads, no noise."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Everything you've unlocked sits in \"My unlocked plugins,\" ready to install, switch, or remove any ti"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"me. Unlocked plugins remember your DSH: reinstall and update without burning the code again."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## For creators: turn your plugin into private-channel income"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Creators work from dshhub.co, signed in with their GitHub account. Two ways to stock your shelf:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Pick a plugin from the official curated catalog\n- Import your own GitHub repository (public or pri"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"vate), or scan the presets & skills tuned in your local DSH"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Then **generate passcodes** and distribute them in your private channels:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Collect payment your way — WeChat, Alipay, Stripe, PayPal, cash, whatever you like;\n2. Send the p"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"asscode to the paying buyer;\n3. The buyer enters the code in DSH and the plugin unlocks and installs"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"e paying buyer;\n3. The buyer enters the code in DSH and the plugin unlocks and installs on the spot."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The platform shows you redemption stats and per-batch breakdowns, so you always know which code reac"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"hed how many people. Passcodes come in two flavors: **one-time** (void after a single redemption — o"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ne order, one code) and **time-limited** (start with T, redeemable by multiple users before expiry)."},{"id":"p18s4","text":" Bulk generation and TXT export make it easy to drop codes into your own auto-delivery flow."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Generating a passcode costs a small number of points — top up whenever you need more."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Quick start: 4 steps, try a passcode"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Step 1 — Install DeepSeek Harness (if you haven't)**"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Paste this into your terminal. The wizard checks Node.js, pnpm and DSH on your machine and walks you"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" through anything that's missing:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Step 2 — Install the passcode marketplace**"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Step 3 — Restart DSH and open the market**"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then open **Settings → Plugin Market**."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Step 4 — Try a passcode**"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Enter the demo code **080808** — a skin plugin unlocks and installs itself on the spot."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"When a buyer gets a passcode from you, they do the same final step: open the market, enter the code,"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" and the plugin installs. No account, no sign-up."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Install options (advanced)"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Requires dsh web 0.1.0-rc.6 or newer. Besides the official wizard above, you can also install with a"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" web 0.1.0-rc.6 or newer. Besides the official wizard above, you can also install with any of these:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Requires dsh web 0.1.0-rc.6 or newer."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"From npm (recommended — smoothest upgrades):"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Or a pinned version from DSHHub.co (versioned links never change, so lockfile checksums stay stable)"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"r a pinned version from DSHHub.co (versioned links never change, so lockfile checksums stay stable):"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Or from GitHub:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then open **Settings → Plugin Market**."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"> Note: if you install from the website versioned link, run `pnpm install --update-checksums` in the"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" profile directory after each release (the link points at the latest tarball, so the lockfile checks"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"um needs a refresh). GitHub installs work out of the box, with no build scripts to allow.\n>\n> On an "},{"id":"p41s4","text":"older host the market disables itself and says so in the browser console — if the Plugin Market entr"},{"id":"p41s5","text":"y never appears, that's usually why."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Under the hood"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"As a market app it also carries these real capabilities:"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"- **Passcode unlock & install** — enter a code, it installs; sources are validated against the DSHHu"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"b.co registry allowlist\n- **Theme skins** — apply instantly, no restart\n- **Update / uninstall** — t"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"wo-step confirm against accidents\n- **Hot disable / enable** — takes effect in about a second, survi"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"ves reboots\n- **Backup & restore** — daily auto-backup to WebDAV, or sync across machines via a priv"},{"id":"p44s5","text":"ate Gist\n- **Diagnostics** — load order and conflicts on one page\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"- Installs are restricted to sources in the DSHHub.co registry — anything else is rejected\n- Code fr"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"om private repositories never enters the public catalog — it passes through the platform only when a"},{"id":"p46s3","text":" buyer redeems a code\n- Build scripts stay blocked by default; allowing one is your explicit choice\n"},{"id":"p46s4","text":"- The install endpoint accepts same-origin requests only\n- The local bridge for dshhub.co accepts lo"},{"id":"p46s5","text":"opback and dshhub.co origins only\n- Clear warnings before backup export; logs are sanitized througho"},{"id":"p46s6","text":"back and dshhub.co origins only\n- Clear warnings before backup export; logs are sanitized throughout"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
